{"nodes":[{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Orange — Courage**\nA boxer mouse girl who hides her real fear under a tough facade; Flowery's \"little sister,\" with her own subplot alongside Pink.","x":-440,"y":-160,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Seth — Perseverance**\nA bespectacled intellectual who idolizes Berdly as the \"avian genius\" — even imitates his poses and bargains with Kris in exchange for one of his feathers.","x":-660,"y":-500,"width":280,"height":220,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Aqua — Patience**\nThe most childish and impulsive; treats everything like a game, including her own fight. Attacks with knives.","x":-480,"y":-840,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Yellow — Justice**\nA credulous cowboy who punishes himself for crimes he didn't commit; hands out a key in the Flower Castle.","x":50,"y":-940,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# 7 Colored Flowers\n🌸 Asgore and Toriel's wedding bouquet, coming to life in the Dark World of Ch.5 — six of them mirror the human SOULs from Undertale.","x":10,"y":-540,"width":380,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Blue — Integrity**\nAn elegant dancer, Yellow's partner (\"dear\"); somewhat flexible morals but always tries to even things out in the end.","x":600,"y":-850,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Green — Kindness**\nA calm, practical cook; his attacks are literally food that heals the party.","x":740,"y":-470,"width":280,"height":190,"color":"3"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Flowery**\nTheir \"brother\" and leader — the seventh flower, with no associated human virtue, who summons them all for the final battle of Ch.5.","x":680,"y":-120,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flowery_battle_idle.gif","x":740,"y":80,"width":158,"height":170},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nHe cared for them for years, far beyond their natural lifespan, purely out of fondness for his wedding bouquet with Toriel.","x":-460,"y":250,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_Dreemurr_overworld.webp","x":-420,"y":450,"width":120,"height":170},{"id":"s8","type":"text","text":"**Berdly**\nSeth idolizes him as the \"avian genius\" he aspires to resemble.","x":-880,"y":-160,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"4"},{"id":"s8-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Berdly_battle_intro.gif","x":-840,"y":20,"width":200,"height":112},{"id":"s9","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nAlready talking to the Light World version of Seth long before Ch.5, trading his help for one of Berdly's feathers.","x":20,"y":165,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s9-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":60,"y":365,"width":200,"height":122},{"id":"s10","type":"text","text":"**Why does Flowery get Determination?**\nThe other six mirror the 6 human SOULs from Undertale; Flowery represents the seventh, Determination — the same trait that defines Flowey in Undertale for having no SOUL of his own.","x":539,"y":450,"width":280,"height":230,"color":"1"},{"id":"s11-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":128,"y":-1440,"width":85,"height":170},{"id":"s11","type":"text","text":"**Noelle = key, like Yellow?**\nOn the Sword Route (Ch.3), the White Cloak representing her gets \"used\" on a door just like the Ice Key — \"She was used up,\" just like the key. Connects to Yellow via Undertale's \"Just-Ice\" pun.","x":10,"y":-1295,"width":320,"height":250,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Aqua_battle_idle.gif","x":-480,"y":-1030,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Seth_battle_idle.gif","x":-660,"y":-690,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Orange_battle_idle.gif","x":-440,"y":-350,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Green_battle_idle.gif","x":740,"y":-660,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Yellow_battle_idle.gif","x":50,"y":-1130,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Blue_battle_idle.gif","x":600,"y":-1040,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/7_Colored_Flowers_screenshot_enemies.png","x":10,"y":-760,"width":260,"height":200},{"id":"s12","type":"text","text":"**Mad Mew Mew (Pink)**\nThey share the Flower Kingdom Diner, where you can invite different characters to a date/conversation after defeating her as a secret boss. Orange visits her there and calls her \"big sister.\"","x":-440,"y":240,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s12-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flower_Tea_Time_screenshot_Pink_welcome.png","x":-440,"y":470,"width":220,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e_s0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s8","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s9","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s10","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s10","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s7-img","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s8-img","fromNode":"s8-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s9-img","fromNode":"s9-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s11","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s11","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s11-img","fromNode":"s11-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s11","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"6f9123cd18218ec3","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s10","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_center-img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s12","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s12","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s12-img","fromNode":"s12-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s12","toSide":"top","color":"4"}]}